WEBVTT

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:12.130
If this continues, I'm done for.

00:01:49.690 --> 00:01:54.650
Damn Kagami!
He really went overboard!

00:01:59.950 --> 00:02:02.910
You're wasting your movement.
Use the opponent's power.

00:02:06.330 --> 00:02:07.580
Have a wonderful day!

00:02:07.580 --> 00:02:08.790
Master Alma.

00:02:12.210 --> 00:02:16.800
I know I get to eat all I want for free,
but my body can't keep up.

00:02:17.180 --> 00:02:19.430
I think I should just find a job.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:21.760
Hey, morning!

00:02:22.220 --> 00:02:24.390
Morning just started, and you're already tired.

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:26.600
Huh? What gave you that idea?

00:02:27.770 --> 00:02:29.690
Recently, you always seem busy.

00:02:29.690 --> 00:02:31.690
I guess...

00:02:32.190 --> 00:02:36.400
Look, I hardly see you
at the river these days.

00:02:37.990 --> 00:02:43.330
Because of all that rain we had,
there's bound to be new stones.

00:02:43.620 --> 00:02:46.700
I think it'll be worth the trip
to go search for some.

00:02:46.700 --> 00:02:47.660
Club leader.

00:02:48.290 --> 00:02:49.250
Yes?

00:02:49.620 --> 00:02:50.920
I was wondering...

00:02:51.710 --> 00:02:54.380
Why did you recruit a guy
like me for your club?

00:02:54.550 --> 00:02:58.760
Hey, you shouldn't talk like that about yourself.

00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:00.680
Um, yeah but...

00:03:00.680 --> 00:03:02.970
Tandoji, you're pretty awesome.

00:03:03.600 --> 00:03:07.560
Since you joined the club,
we've increased our members.

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.560
And we've met so many nice stones.

00:03:10.940 --> 00:03:13.820
You need to be more confident!

00:03:15.400 --> 00:03:16.940
I just don't get it.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:20.740
Well, how should I say this...
You reminded me of something.

00:03:20.740 --> 00:03:21.530
What?

00:03:21.740 --> 00:03:25.740
Tandoji, that time you were
collecting stones at the river.

00:03:25.830 --> 00:03:28.540
You reminded me of a stone.

00:03:31.000 --> 00:03:32.000
A stone?

00:03:32.420 --> 00:03:33.920
Yes, a stone.

00:03:34.790 --> 00:03:37.050
The kind you want to collect.

00:03:48.520 --> 00:03:53.020
I'll be collecting the math assignment.
Please pass them forward from the back.

00:03:53.020 --> 00:03:55.860
Oh no, I forgot!

00:03:55.940 --> 00:03:57.730
It's all his fault!

00:03:59.780 --> 00:04:00.900
Alma.

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.990
Because of the training, you didn't have
any time to do the assignment, right?

00:04:05.450 --> 00:04:06.450
Here.

00:04:06.620 --> 00:04:07.620
What?

00:04:07.790 --> 00:04:12.870
We shouldn't be doing this, but
you're fighting for everyone's safety.

00:04:12.870 --> 00:04:14.040
So you deserve this much.

00:04:14.290 --> 00:04:16.460
It's OK? For real?

00:04:16.840 --> 00:04:17.550
Well, OK then--

00:04:17.550 --> 00:04:18.630
You there!

00:04:18.630 --> 00:04:20.670
What are you guys doing?

00:04:21.380 --> 00:04:23.630
Hm, I see.

00:04:23.760 --> 00:04:27.310
So instead of doing it himself,
Ruri did Alma's assignment.

00:04:27.310 --> 00:04:28.600
Is that what's going on?

00:04:28.600 --> 00:04:30.520
N-No, that's not--

00:04:30.520 --> 00:04:32.390
Cheating isn't allowed.

00:04:32.390 --> 00:04:36.770
I understand your admirable dedication
to the man you love.

00:04:36.770 --> 00:04:37.940
No, you've got it all wrong!

00:04:37.940 --> 00:04:38.900
That's not the case!

00:04:39.360 --> 00:04:39.570
I know, I know, but this kind of thing...

00:04:39.570 --> 00:04:42.700
That's not the case!

00:04:42.700 --> 00:04:44.780
Please listen to me!

00:04:45.910 --> 00:04:49.740
You know, everyone
has changed a bit!

00:04:50.750 --> 00:04:58.500
Before, they would have been saying,
"Alma must have threatened Ruri to do his assignment."

00:04:58.500 --> 00:05:00.130
But now it's totally different!

00:05:00.840 --> 00:05:03.670
We're all able to tease him about it.

00:05:03.670 --> 00:05:08.430
Or maybe, we were all afraid just because
he's bigger than everyone else.

00:05:08.430 --> 00:05:13.680
That might be. Well, he did join the club
after Wakana recruited him.

00:05:17.940 --> 00:05:19.150
What?

00:05:19.150 --> 00:05:22.990
We're just talking about
how Tandoji has changed, right?

00:05:24.610 --> 00:05:25.780
Changed what?

00:05:34.500 --> 00:05:40.960
By dividing X squared, Y equals 3XZ.

00:05:47.130 --> 00:05:47.640
MATH II-BB SOLUTIONS

00:05:47.640 --> 00:05:48.850
You're retaking the exam, right?

00:05:49.180 --> 00:05:53.890
I've simplified everything that will be
on the test to your level of intelligence.

00:05:53.890 --> 00:05:55.890
Cram all this into your head, now.

00:05:56.020 --> 00:05:57.850
Th... Thank you.

00:05:57.850 --> 00:06:01.570
Your powers are indispensable
to eradicate the Dark Stones.

00:06:01.730 --> 00:06:04.940
I hope you'll keep making efforts
to help Miss Ruri.

00:06:05.990 --> 00:06:10.070
If you don't get it after reading this,
you'll need to go back to middle school.

00:06:10.990 --> 00:06:12.410
Why you...!

00:06:15.750 --> 00:06:17.080
He did this?

00:06:23.590 --> 00:06:26.920
We've located a Dark Stone
in Jougashima on the Miura Peninsula.

00:06:26.920 --> 00:06:28.930
Contact Mr. Kagami immediately.

00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:30.600
I'm uploading the video.

00:06:31.640 --> 00:06:32.760
Zoom in on the Dark Stone.

00:06:32.760 --> 00:06:33.600
Roger

00:06:39.770 --> 00:06:42.610
Starting analysis of combat capabilities.

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.940
I've detected another Dark Stone.

00:06:45.070 --> 00:06:48.200
Location, 1,500 meters north-northeast of Jougashima.

00:06:48.530 --> 00:06:51.660
Moving at a speed of 15 km/h towards Yokosuka.

00:06:51.950 --> 00:06:54.490
Two Dark Stones appearing
at the same time?

00:07:02.840 --> 00:07:05.130
You passed.

00:07:05.130 --> 00:07:06.760
Thank you.

00:07:06.960 --> 00:07:09.090
All of a sudden you're doing much bette--

00:07:09.090 --> 00:07:10.970
It's not like I'm cheating!

00:07:11.550 --> 00:07:14.810
No, I'm not suspicious.

00:07:14.810 --> 00:07:20.810
It's just that, I'm a bit surprised
you have friends to study with.

00:07:25.110 --> 00:07:26.650
If you'll excuse me.

00:07:28.820 --> 00:07:29.860
Club leader?

00:07:34.080 --> 00:07:36.660
Tandoji, did you pass
the makeup exam?

00:07:36.660 --> 00:07:39.580
Don't fail and make Ruri cry.

00:07:42.080 --> 00:07:43.670
Hey! Tandoji!

00:07:43.670 --> 00:07:46.550
Can you help us out and
play in our game next month?

00:07:46.840 --> 00:07:49.050
If you want, you can be
an official team member!

00:07:50.220 --> 00:07:51.880
What the?

00:07:53.300 --> 00:07:57.010
See, everyone's realized
who you really are.

00:07:57.720 --> 00:07:59.060
Who I really am?

00:07:59.060 --> 00:08:01.560
Yup, it's going to be all right.

00:08:04.560 --> 00:08:08.570
<i>I get it.
I should be like a stone.</i>

00:08:10.280 --> 00:08:12.700
What's changed since then?

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:14.870
The people around me?

00:08:15.830 --> 00:08:17.620
Or was it me?

00:08:18.830 --> 00:08:20.120
At what point?

00:08:21.000 --> 00:08:22.210
Since when?

00:08:25.210 --> 00:08:26.290
It was then...

00:08:28.050 --> 00:08:29.050
... that I...

00:08:31.220 --> 00:08:33.090
...that I started to move.

00:08:41.930 --> 00:08:42.940
Alma!

00:08:43.600 --> 00:08:44.900
We have a situation.

00:08:48.360 --> 00:08:49.940
Sorry, club leader.

00:08:50.230 --> 00:08:52.280
I have to skip today's.

00:09:02.290 --> 00:09:09.050
<i>One of the Dark Stones has stopped at Jougashima. The other is still moving towards Yokosuka.</i>

00:09:09.380 --> 00:09:10.630
Roger that.

00:09:19.060 --> 00:09:20.310
<i>How is it over there?</i>

00:09:20.720 --> 00:09:25.730
We're doing fine.
I'll protect this town and school.

00:09:26.100 --> 00:09:28.980
We've completed the evacuation
of the residents in this area.

00:09:28.980 --> 00:09:32.110
Don't worry about anything,
just focus on your own battle.

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:33.820
<i>I know.</i>

00:09:40.830 --> 00:09:44.370
The timing of two Dark Stones
appearing at the same time.

00:09:44.580 --> 00:09:47.250
This can't be a coincidence, oni.

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:50.130
<i>Alma, please be careful.</i>

00:09:50.130 --> 00:09:54.970
<i>I can't be by your side, but know that my power is with you.</i>

00:09:55.050 --> 00:09:56.970
Pace yourselves, too.

00:09:58.970 --> 00:10:01.930
We'll be arriving at Jougashima shortly.

00:10:30.840 --> 00:10:32.170
Well if you don't move...

00:10:32.170 --> 00:10:33.420
I will!

00:11:05.870 --> 00:11:08.160
<i>All hands are prepared for battle.</i>

00:11:08.160 --> 00:11:11.460
<i>Dark Stone B will be arriving at the mission area shortly.</i>

00:11:11.960 --> 00:11:15.090
<i>Mission consists of guiding the enemy into the Railgun's line of fire,</i>

00:11:15.090 --> 00:11:17.340
<i>by the Maid sharpshooter team and Engagement Suit.</i>

00:11:17.340 --> 00:11:19.090
<i>Starling countdown.</i>

00:11:20.720 --> 00:11:25.310
<i>Five, four, three, two, one.</i>

00:11:25.310 --> 00:11:26.970
Start, oni!

00:11:41.070 --> 00:11:43.450
<i>We've lost the left arm of the Engagement Suit.</i>

00:11:43.450 --> 00:11:44.870
<i>Retreat.</i>

00:11:52.960 --> 00:11:56.000
<i>Dark Stone B internal energy level has increased.</i>

00:11:56.750 --> 00:11:59.090
<i>Go to stage two of the mission plan.</i>

00:11:59.090 --> 00:12:01.130
<i>Maid sharpshooters, fire.</i>

00:12:01.260 --> 00:12:02.550
Yes ma'am.

00:12:13.440 --> 00:12:15.980
Sharpshooter team one
has incurred extensive damage.

00:12:15.980 --> 00:12:18.070
Cannot maintain the defensive line.

00:12:18.070 --> 00:12:20.030
First defensive line is gone.

00:12:20.150 --> 00:12:22.820
Move mission to stage three.

00:12:22.910 --> 00:12:24.160
Yes ma'am.

00:12:35.960 --> 00:12:36.840
<i>Whoa!</i>

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:39.960
<i>Son of a... </i>

00:13:09.410 --> 00:13:13.330
Miss Ruri, charging rate at 87%.

00:13:13.460 --> 00:13:14.330
Roger

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:22.590
Hold on just a bit longer, Kagami.

00:13:36.600 --> 00:13:37.690
Alma!

00:13:58.210 --> 00:13:59.540
Not good!

00:14:09.600 --> 00:14:10.760
Alma...

00:14:18.270 --> 00:14:20.560
Mr. Kagami! This is Point Delta.

00:14:20.560 --> 00:14:25.190
Preparations complete for forced deployment
of the Corundum Laser Cannon.

00:14:25.190 --> 00:14:26.280
Great!

00:14:26.360 --> 00:14:28.070
Systems, start!

00:14:42.420 --> 00:14:43.300
What?

00:15:04.480 --> 00:15:04.690
<i>Kagami, get up!</i>

00:15:04.690 --> 00:15:06.610
<i>98 percent...</i>

00:15:06.690 --> 00:15:08.570
<i>99 percent...</i>

00:15:08.650 --> 00:15:09.450
Kagami!

00:15:09.450 --> 00:15:09.700
700 percent.

00:15:09.700 --> 00:15:10.740
<i>100 percent.</i>

00:15:11.780 --> 00:15:13.280
<i>Charging complete.</i>

00:15:13.280 --> 00:15:14.200
Fire!

00:15:20.370 --> 00:15:21.750
We missed the core?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:31.260
Miss Ruri, please get in.

00:15:40.310 --> 00:15:43.560
Stop now, monster!

00:16:03.290 --> 00:16:07.420
If this continues, I'm done for.

00:16:21.940 --> 00:16:23.520
I can't protect them?

00:16:24.480 --> 00:16:27.770
I can't protect them all?

00:16:41.790 --> 00:16:43.710
I can't give up.

00:16:44.540 --> 00:16:46.790
There's only one thing I can do.

00:16:47.500 --> 00:16:51.260
To protect everyone
from the Dark Stones.

00:16:51.840 --> 00:16:53.930
Someone with power like mine...

00:16:54.470 --> 00:16:56.430
Can't give up!

00:17:06.940 --> 00:17:09.190
I won't lose!

00:17:19.580 --> 00:17:21.580
You're finished!

00:17:38.600 --> 00:17:40.970
Hurry! Faster!

00:17:41.770 --> 00:17:43.430
Even faster!

00:17:46.270 --> 00:17:48.440
Power to run as swift as an arrow!

00:18:18.430 --> 00:18:19.510
Kagami!

00:18:37.860 --> 00:18:38.990
Alma!

00:18:42.780 --> 00:18:44.790
Go to hell!

00:18:55.010 --> 00:18:56.880
Just in time.

00:18:58.470 --> 00:18:59.680
Thank goodness.

00:19:03.010 --> 00:19:04.890
Miss Ruri, I'm so glad.

00:19:35.960 --> 00:19:37.460
That can't be!

00:19:37.710 --> 00:19:41.720
The first two Dark Stones,
they were decoys to keep us away?

00:19:45.850 --> 00:19:47.600
It's headed toward the town.

00:19:48.020 --> 00:19:49.560
Oh no!

00:19:51.600 --> 00:19:52.900
Damn it!

00:19:55.110 --> 00:19:56.480
I've gotta go.

00:19:58.780 --> 00:19:59.950
Alma!

00:20:02.070 --> 00:20:03.160
I'm fine.

00:20:06.410 --> 00:20:09.450
Your power is still with me.

00:20:10.000 --> 00:20:11.000
I'm off.

00:20:13.710 --> 00:20:14.790
Alma.

00:20:16.130 --> 00:20:22.760
My body's reached its limit,
but my blood still cries out to fly!

00:20:24.090 --> 00:20:26.600
Power to shoot through the sky!

00:21:38.170 --> 00:21:39.750
Tandoji?

00:21:40.170 --> 00:21:41.250
Club leader.

00:21:41.800 --> 00:21:43.300
What happened to you?

00:21:43.300 --> 00:21:45.930
You usually aren't here
in the morning.

00:21:45.930 --> 00:21:48.050
What? This stone.

00:21:49.050 --> 00:21:49.850
Yeah.

00:21:49.970 --> 00:21:52.600
You kept it, all this time?

00:21:52.890 --> 00:21:53.850
Yeah.

00:21:54.230 --> 00:21:59.310
To be honest, you helped me
a lot by giving me this one.

00:22:00.190 --> 00:22:02.190
I'm grateful, really.

00:22:02.320 --> 00:22:06.200
Oh, really? It was nothing special.

00:22:06.320 --> 00:22:10.660
But if it helped you,
then this one must be happy.

00:22:11.580 --> 00:22:17.170
See, you have so many friends here.
You'll never be lonely.

00:22:17.750 --> 00:22:18.960
You're right!

00:22:19.250 --> 00:22:23.300
You have to keep collecting more,
to make this place lively.

00:22:23.800 --> 00:22:28.090
Let's meet at the riverside
after school. OK?

00:22:28.300 --> 00:22:29.180
Huh?

00:22:29.850 --> 00:22:31.890
Club leader's orders.

00:22:31.890 --> 00:22:34.720
If you're late, you owe us all juice.

00:22:40.230 --> 00:22:41.860
Really, you can't be late!

00:22:41.860 --> 00:22:42.770
OK, I get it!

00:22:42.770 --> 00:22:44.070
Wonder what will happen?
